  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Trong <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Mặt khác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>tan</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mo>tan</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mo>tan</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo>tan</mo><mover><mro